{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29078","headline":"送黄隐居归南海 · 许浑","name":"送黄隐居归南海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瘴雾南边久寄家，海中来往信流槎。\n林藏●●多残笋，树过猩猩少落花。\n深洞有云龙蜕骨，半岩无草象生牙。\n知君爱宿层峰顶，坐到三更见日华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}